<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"  xml:id="chapter-12-intro">
  <title>Week 12</title>
  <introduction><p>
  This week will just be reviewing for the exam and initial interviews -- no new topics. Exam #3 will involve 
  developing methods with simple loops and tracing programs involving a nested loop.
  Be prepared to code a problem similar to  
  <url href="https://codingbat.com/java/String-2" visual="codingbat String-2">String-2</url>.
  on paper, from scratch (including method header definitions). Practice with 
  <url href="https://codingbat.com/java/Array-1" visual="codingbat Array-1">Array-1</url> and 
  <url href="https://codingbat.com/java/Array-2" visual="codingbat Array-2">Array-2</url> to be 
  well prepared for other questions on the exam. </p>
  </introduction>
</chapter>
